OL,3,GNEWSATown to turn red with street
OL,4,Apoppies for veterans
OL,5,
OL,6,FTracy Turner, from the town's branch of
OL,7,Fthe Royal British Legion, which is
OL,8,Fbehind the campaign, said: "It is very
OL,9,Fimportant that we don't forget their
OL,10,Fsacrifices. People lost their lives so
OL,11,Fwe could do what we do today."
